.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct 1  "oct 0.11.13" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct \- A tool for inspecting, configuring and using OpenPGP cards
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct\fR [\fB\-\-output\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-output\-version\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
A tool for inspecting, configuring and using OpenPGP cards
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-output\-format\fR \fI<OUTPUT_FORMAT>\fR [default: text]
Produce output in the chosen format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
text
.IP \(bu 2
yaml
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-output\-version\fR \fI<OUTPUT_VERSION>\fR [default: 0.11.0]
Pick output version to use, for non\-textual formats
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
oct\-list(1)
Enumerate available OpenPGP cards
.TP
oct\-status(1)
Show information about the data on a card
.TP
oct\-info(1)
Show technical details about a card
.TP
oct\-ssh(1)
Show a card\*(Aqs authentication key as an SSH public key
.TP
oct\-pubkey(1)
Export the key data on a card as an OpenPGP public key
.TP
oct\-admin(1)
Administer data on a card (including keys and metadata)
.TP
oct\-pin(1)
PIN management (change PINs, reset blocked PINs)
.TP
oct\-decrypt(1)
Decrypt data using a card
.TP
oct\-sign(1)
Sign data using a card
.TP
oct\-attestation(1)
Attestation management (Yubico only)
.TP
oct\-system(1)
Initialization and similar functionality
.TP
oct\-output\-versions(1)
Show supported output format versions
.TP
oct\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.11.13
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Heiko Schaefer <heiko@schaefer.name>
